Hello friends, welcome to your channel HSE study guide.

2
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:08,920
In today's video we are going to talk about the MCQ test of the work permit system.

3
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,960
And you can also find out how much knowledge you have about it through this test.

4
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:17,080
So let's start the video.

5
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:22,280
So the first question is why do we use the work permit system?

6
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:27,720
So for this option A has been given that to control the work in the restricted area,

7
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:34,640
option B is to perform the work safely so that unwanted incidents can be prevented.

8
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:44,160
Option C is to implement control measures effectively and option D is to select the correct answer here.

9
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:48,280
So the correct answer is option D all of the above.

10
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:54,280
Then the question is what is covered in the work permit is also safety related.

11
00:00:54,280 --> 00:01:05,720
So option A is that the statutory requirement is also, as per OSHA standard, option B is that the statutory requirement is also according to regulatory bodies,

12
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:15,480
option C is that the minimum safety measures so that risk can be controlled and option D is that the standard list applicable for all types of work.

13
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:18,720
So you have to select the correct answer here.

14
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:21,240
So the correct answer is option C.

15
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:27,960
Then the next question is which of the work is low risk for which the permit is not required.

16
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:38,360
So option A is that the radiography is option B, hot work is option C, cleaning and sweeping work and option D is the hydrotesting of the pipelines.

17
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:41,120
So you have to select the correct answer here.

18
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:43,920
So the correct answer is option C.

19
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:48,760
Then the next question is what is the main objective of the work permit system.

20
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:58,120
So option A is given for this that to comply with the company policy, option B is given that to maintain documents and records for the audit,

21
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:06,000
option C is given to prevent the incident and option D is given to generate data for accident investigation.

22
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:09,040
So the correct answer is you have to select it here.

23
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:11,600
So the correct answer is option C.

24
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:18,800
Then the next question is what should the issuer check before issuing the hot work permit.

25
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:25,280
So option A is given for this that the receiver should also check the authorised signature of the permit.

26
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:36,440
So the control measures specified in the permit is option C, the competent fire watch is available and option D is all.

27
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:39,600
So you have to select the correct answer here.

28
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:42,040
So the correct answer is option D.

29
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:49,040
Then the next question is what should the issuer discuss before the joint site visit.

30
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:55,280
So the option A is given for this that what is the requirement of the OSHA for specific work, they should discuss it.

31
00:02:55,280 --> 00:03:03,680
Option B is given that the lifting or other machines or equipment should check the certifications of it.

32
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:14,520
Option C is given that what is the scope of work, what equipment is going to be used there, or any special conditions because of which the safety can be affected.

33
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:19,960
And option D is given that what is the competency of the fire watch, stand-by-by persons or workers.

34
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:22,560
So what should they discuss about this.

35
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:25,640
So what are the correct options for this, you have to select it.

36
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:28,440
So the correct answer is option C.

37
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:33,000
Then the next question is what is the restricted area among these.

38
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:40,360
So option A is given for this, mechanical workshop, option B is the fabrication yard which is away from the operational area.

39
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:48,680
Option C is the laboratory where the chemicals are handled and option D is the flammable material handling pump area.

40
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:51,800
So you have to select the correct answer here.

41
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:54,640
So the correct answer is option D.

42
00:03:54,640 --> 00:04:02,080
Then the next question is what are the conditions in which the permit issuer can decide

43
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:06,720
that the permit that is not required there is also for a specific work.

44
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:21,440
So option A is given for this that when low risk work is done, option B is given that when short term work is done, option C is given that when low cost work is done and option D is given, none of it is given.

45
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:24,720
So what is the correct option for this, you have to select it here.

46
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:27,240
So the correct answer is option A.

47
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:33,000
Then the next question is what condition can be cancelled by the work permit.

48
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:38,880
So option A is that if the observer is non-compliance and that also agrees with the permit condition.

49
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:46,920
Option B is also given in emergency, option C is given in bad weather and option D is given in all these.

50
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:50,160
So the correct answer is you have to select it here.

51
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:52,880
So the correct answer is option D.

52
00:04:53,080 --> 00:05:00,520
And then the next question is who performs the joint side inspection before issuing the work permit.

53
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:16,120
So option A is given for this, worker and permit issuer option B is also given, worker and permit issuer option C is given, permit issuer and receiver and option D is given, area manager along with worker and receiver.

54
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:19,360
So what is the correct answer for this, you have to select it here.

55
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:23,640
So the correct answer is option C, permit issuer and receiver.

56
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:31,240
So friends I hope you got to know about the MCQ test of the work permit system through this video.

57
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:36,200
